[node name="InstructionsLabel" type="Label" parent="HowToPlayPopup/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "🐞 Control the ladybug with code!

📝 Movement Commands:
• move() - Move forward one cell
• turnRight() - Turn 90° clockwise
• turnLeft() - Turn 90° counter-clockwise
• turnBack() - Turn 180° around

🔍 Sensors:
• frontIsClear() - Check if front is walkable
• leftIsClear() - Check if left is walkable
• rightIsClear() - Check if right is walkable
• goalReached() - Check if at goal
• onHazard() - Check if on hazard

🔄 Control Flow:
• if/elif/else - Conditional execution
• for loops - Repeat with counter
• while loops - Repeat while condition true
• function - Define reusable code

🎯 Goal: Reach the green goal tile!
⚠️ Avoid red hazards - they're deadly!

💡 Example:
while (frontIsClear()) {
    move()
}
turnRight()
move()"
autowrap_mode = 3

